8449	        // M17.5 pass-2 #12: the `critical` guard let a non-critical requirement
8450	        // sit in the inventory forever with no test behind it, inflating the
8451	        // requirement count without adding any evidence. Every declared
8452	        // requirement must be mapped; criticality decides how MUCH evidence is
